      explanation: "f(a) = a² + 1, so f(f(a)) = (a² + 1)² + 1. Setting this equal to 5 gives (a² + 1)² = 4, so a² + 1 = 2 and a² = 1. Among the options, only a = 1 satisfies this (a = −1 also works but is not listed). Answer B.",
