      text: "BUDGET A: \"Marketing allocated $80,000 for Q3.\"\nBUDGET B: \"Product development allocated $120,000 for Q3.\"\nREPORT: \"Actual Q3 spending was 10% under budget overall.\"\n\nWhich of the following is most strongly supported?",
